flowchart TB
  change[Merge reviewed change to main] --> workflow[GitHub Actions workflow]
  editor[Client publishes an allowed content edit] -->|commit through source adapter| siteRepo[Client site repository]
  siteRepo --> workflow

  workflow --> runner{Job runner}
  runner -->|raizhost-app| codebuild[Fresh CodeBuild environment<br/>one job, then destroyed]
  runner -->|other onboarded paths| hosted[GitHub-hosted runner]
  codebuild --> oidc[Assume repository/ref-scoped<br/>AWS deploy role through OIDC]
  hosted --> oidc

  oidc --> target{Deployment target}
  target -->|static site| static[Build + four-pass S3 sync<br/>per-class cache-control]
  static --> invalidate[CloudFront invalidation]
  invalidate --> verify[Live verification]

  target -->|Lambda app| lambda[Build arm64 image or ZIP<br/>publish immutable artifact]
  lambda --> activate[Update Lambda<br/>wait for Active]

  target -->|client editor| portal[Build arm64 image<br/>push to ECR]
  portal --> ssm[SSM RunCommand on anchor]
  ssm --> health{Health check}
  health -->|pass| live[Advance .last-good<br/>invalidate CloudFront]
  health -->|fail| rollback[Roll back automatically]

  tf[aws-infra CI] --> staticOnly[Static validation only while drift is open<br/>no AWS identity, live plan, or auto-apply]

